# 统一换行：GDScript / 配置按 CRLF 检出（仓库里的文件本来就是 CRLF，
# 强制 LF 会让每次提交都变成全文件重写）。
* text=auto
*.gd text eol=crlf
*.tscn text eol=crlf
*.tres text eol=crlf
*.cfg text eol=crlf
*.godot text eol=crlf
*.json text eol=lf
*.md text eol=lf
*.yml text eol=lf
*.sh text eol=lf
*.py text eol=lf

# 二进制：不要尝试 diff / 合并
*.png binary
*.jpg binary
*.ico binary
*.fxc binary
*.pck binary
*.exe binary
*.ttf binary
*.otf binary
*.wav binary
*.ogg binary
